    "system": {
      "baseItem": null,
      "bulk": 0,
      "containerId": null,
      "description": "<p>With cutting edge surgery, you're implanted with an magical gland modified to function for a creature of your ancestry at the back of your throat. Choose your breath weapon's damage type when the organ is biocrafted from the following list: acid, cold, electricity, fire, or sonic. You gain the following activation.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Exhale</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (manipulate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per 10 minutes</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Each creature in a @Template[type:cone|distance:15] takes @Damage[(1d6)[untyped]] damage with a @Check[reflex|dc:15|basic] save. The damage depends on the augmentation's version.</p>",
